# Standard guided-missile launcher (the former hardcoded "Missile Launcher").
# Fire-and-seek: missiles steer onto hostiles after launch. Hot engines make them
# easy to see coming; 3.5 hp costs enemy PD a real dwell to burn down.
id          harpoon_rack
name        "Harpoon Missile Rack"
kind        missile
size        M
icon        ic-missile
damage      40
reload      4.0
proj_speed  10000
proj_life   400
proj_radius 6.0
cap_cost    25
emission    0.9
proj_hp     3.5
# Tactical range (autopilot approach / ROE acquisition / HUD ring): outranges the gun
# catalog (19k-58k) so missile boats fight from standoff, without the 4,000k flight
# endurance leaking into engagement geometry. Flight time stays proj_life (PD counterplay).
engage_range 60000
price       900
tier        1
desc "Fire-and-seek ordnance. Hot engines make every launch visible from across the system, but a harpoon that connects does the work of ten shells."
